= Senator Onaconda Farr of Rodia

Rodia’s genial, wily senator has spent decades speaking for worlds the Core forgets. He is beloved in the Rim and is a mentor to a generation of young senators.

[? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : *Our advisors can act again in [+ advisor_action_timer +] turn(s).* ?]

- @farr_solidarity: Rim solidarity.
- @farr_relief: Organise a relief convoy.
- @farr_bargain: Strike a quiet bargain.
- @go_back: Back.

@farr_solidarity
subtitle: +8 relations with the Rimward Coalition, more support in the Outer Rim.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: rim_relation += 8; outer_rc += 1.5; advisor_action_timer = 5

Farr calls in favours with every Rim delegation that ever owed Rodia a kindness. It is a long list.

@farr_relief
subtitle: −3 Outer Rim hardship; costs 1 political capital.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; rim_hardship -= 3; outer_sep -= 1.5; advisor_action_timer = 5

Rodian freighters, Caucus money and a great deal of goodwill: the convoy will not fix the Rim, but it reminds the Rim that someone cares.

@farr_bargain
subtitle: +1 political capital; calms the Rimward wing.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: capital += 1; rimward_dissent -= 5; advisor_action_timer = 5

Farr trades a vote nobody cares about for a favour everybody will. He has done this before.
